{
  "_note": "Where each species lives, per zone (docs/gdd/09-weapons-and-habitats.md). Creatures spawn only at their homes, never at random. where: landmark (zone7.json landmarks, i.e. zones.json landmark ids), room (a Long Seed room id), band (radius fraction 0-1 and bearing range in degrees, 0 = north, clockwise; layoutPosition convention), biome (raid.json host biome id), nearExtract (patrols the approach to the active extract), guards (a container type: sits over one). spread = metres the group is scattered round the point. roam = leash in metres: how far it wanders from home before drifting back (PvE AI). fallback = where to put it until the primary place is built. milestone = the group only appears from that milestone on. The player spawn's noEnemyWithin rule (raid.json) still wins.",
  "rules": {
    "reinforceFrom": "the nearest home of that species that is out of the host's sight and at least reinforcements.spawnMinDistanceFromPlayer away; the group walks in from there, never appears behind the host",
    "noRandomSpawns": true
  },
